{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","勇者连斩"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","勇者の連続斬り"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","向前方连续进行斩击，随后使出大范围的终结斩击。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","前方へ連続斬撃を繰り出し、その後、さらに広範囲斬撃を放つ"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","选择一个方向，对前方3格长、3格宽的所有敌人进行9次连续斩击，每次造成60% + 6% ATK伤害。之后使出大范围斩击，对前方所有敌人造成220% + 30% ATK伤害，并附带敌人15% + 2%最大生命值（最高不超过辛美尔300% + 30% ATK）的真实伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","選択した方向の長さ3マス、幅3マス以内の敵全体に連続斬撃を9回繰り出し、1回の斬撃につき、60% + 6% ATKのダメージを与える。その後、広範囲斬撃を放ち、前方の敵全体に220% + 30% ATKのダメージを与え、追加で敵のHP上限×15% + 2%（ヒンメルの300% + 30% ATKを超えない）の確定ダメージを与える"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":38,"end":43,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":73,"end":79,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":94,"end":99,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"},{"start":117,"end":123,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg5"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":48,"end":53,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":91,"end":97,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":123,"end":128,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"},{"start":138,"end":144,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg5"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":35,"end":47,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":69,"end":83,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":113,"end":127,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":45,"end":57,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":87,"end":101,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":134,"end":148,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","终结斩击伤害提高至240% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","広範囲斬撃のダメージが240% + 30% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/des